        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "Have been here a handful of times over the last 10 years. While a couple of my favorite items are no longer available, they still have some of the items we really enjoy. The BBQ buns are to die for!\n\n過去十年間來過這裡好幾次。雖然我最喜歡的幾樣東西已經沒有了，但他們仍然有一些我們很喜歡的菜色。烤肉包簡直好吃到爆！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
